  "body": "Wake to birdsong, wander down to the shore, or start the day with a coffee at the garden café before a quick gym session. Then unwind with a sauna and a dip in the heated pool. Here, everyday living feels like a holiday, yet this is the security and simplicity of freehold ownership.\r\n\r\nSet within the sought-after Kensington Park community, this beautifully crafted terraced townhouse combines contemporary comfort with an enviable coastal lifestyle, just moments from Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nElevated for peace of mind and perfectly positioned to capture the sun, this is a home designed for easy living. Generous windows fill the interiors with natural light, while fresh sea breezes flow throughout. The master suite and living spaces enjoy beautiful morning light, while the covered balcony captures the afternoon sun, an inviting spot for entertaining, relaxing with a glass of wine, or simply enjoying the outlook.\r\n\r\nClean lines and contemporary finishes create a calm, coastal feel. The sleek, well-appointed kitchen offers quality appliances, excellent storage and everything you need for effortless everyday living or entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nThe double garage provides secure parking for two vehicles, along with valuable space for bikes, beach gear, hobbies and storage.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the lifestyle beyond your front door. Kensington Park's beautifully maintained grounds, fruit trees, picnic areas and a pétanque court are there to enjoy, without the upkeep. Resident garden plots are also available if you'd like to grow your own produce. With the ability to simply lock up and leave, weekends can be spent exploring rather than maintaining.\r\n\r\nAdd easy access to Orewa Beach, local cafés, shops, public transport and the Northern Motorway, and you have a home that makes coastal living feel effortless.\r\n\r\nA little like being on holiday, every day - with all the comforts of home.\r\n\r\nYour Kensington Park escape awaits.\r\n\r\nViewing available today. Contact Jaimee Durham on 027 389 2989 to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ADSL",
